// Survival offices scenario for Worldwake.
//
// Purpose: land roadmap row 11 with a truthful survival-backed office and
// notice-posting proof seam. `Claimant Rhea` starts with authored remembered
// local conflict memory, so the same survival scenario can now exercise both
// `ClaimOffice` and autonomous `PostNotice` without test-only belief seeding.
//
// Lawful competing affordances intentionally constrained:
// - no social relay, trade, justice, theft, or combat branches
// - only one authored office and one consultable local register
// - food, water, wash, and latrine remain co-located so the row stays about
//   office pressure competing with survival needs rather than route planning
(
    seed: 611011,
    survival_health_contract: (
        max_authored_critical_run_ticks: 220,
        max_idle_window_ticks_with_elevated_need: 30,
        elevated_need_floor: 300,
        required_self_care_families: [Eat, Drink, Sleep, Relieve, Wash],
    ),
    places: [
        (name: "Council Green", tags: [Village, Field, Latrine]),
    ],
